/// <summary>
/// Compares every wire construct against a hand-written <c>Fixtures/*.json</c> file, byte-for-byte.
/// The fixtures were authored from the rules in the ADR and the issue's own worked example, never
/// generated by running this package's serializer and saving the output - that would only prove the
/// implementation agrees with itself.
/// </summary>
